              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Winston"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was loved by all,even the non zucchini lovers. I skipped the butter and sprayed the cookie sheet with spray cooking oil. I also sprinkled garlic powder on the ones with mozzarella cheese. I sprinkled lemon pepper on the ones with cheddar. I use whatever cheese I have handy.",
