              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mariahleigh44"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Amazing idea! I added some onion, garlic, tomato and Italian seasoning. Baked it at 425 for 10 min., added shredded cheddar/jack cheese and broiled it for 5min. Amazing!!!",
            "datePublished": "2019-05-29T01:02:22.043Z"
