            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Martha Humes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used baby zucchini sliced in half lengthwise added lemon-pepper &amp; garlic salt to season them sautéed in about 1/2 the amount of butter No cheddar so substituted shredded mozzarella cheese. It was a definite hit! And is delicious hot out of the broiler or at room temp.",
            "datePublished": "2020-05-11T21:59:37.537Z"
          },
          {
