            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carol"
            },
            "reviewBody": "With added seasonings, I'd rate it a 4, but without, rather bland and no more than a 3. I followed other reviewers suggestions, though, and added onions and seasoning salt. Next time I'll add even more seasonings. I'd planned to throw the leftovers into a frittata tomorrow morning, but it turned out that there weren't any leftovers. It was a quick and easy way to use up some zucchini.",
            "datePublished": "2016-01-05T18:50:47.563Z"
